sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent
    participant ToolService
    participant Examples as examples/
    participant FileSystem as custom/
    participant Database

    Agent->>ToolService: Get tool template/examples
    ToolService->>Examples: Read template.py or example files
    Examples-->>ToolService: Template/example code
    ToolService-->>Agent: Template/example code

    Note over Agent: Agent writes tool code<br/>based on template/examples

    Agent->>ToolService: Create custom tool

    Note over ToolService: Sanitize name<br/>Validate code syntax<br/>Check create_tools() exists

    alt Validation fails
        ToolService-->>Agent: Error: Invalid name/code
    end

    ToolService->>FileSystem: Write {category}_tool.py

    alt File already exists
        ToolService-->>Agent: Error: Tool already exists
    end

    Note over ToolService: Load module<br/>Call create_tools(0)

    alt Module load fails
        ToolService->>FileSystem: Delete file
        ToolService-->>Agent: Error: Failed to load
    end

    ToolService->>Database: Register Tool records<br/>(category, scope=local,<br/>is_system=False, created_by_agent_id)
    Database-->>ToolService: Tools registered

    ToolService->>Database: Grant to creating agent<br/>(AgentTool records)
    Database-->>ToolService: Access granted

    ToolService-->>Agent: Success: Tool created
